; ARexx acceptance: a package root of its own, SYS:PkgRx, holding the
; controlled index and the cached archives, and PkgManager on it with an
; event log. --slow 500 makes a download slow enough to cancel and holds
; every install in its extraction phase for 10 s, long enough for a script
; to act while the library refuses a cancel.
Failat 21
Protect RAM:rxt/PkgManager +e
Protect RAM:rxt/apkg +e
Delete SYS:PkgRx ALL FORCE QUIET
MakeDir SYS:PkgRx
MakeDir SYS:PkgRx/db
MakeDir SYS:PkgRx/cache
Copy RAM:rxt/IDX1 SYS:PkgRx/db/index.json
Copy RAM:rxt/SOLR1 SYS:PkgRx/cache/soliton.zip
Copy RAM:rxt/CLSZIP SYS:PkgRx/cache/cls.zip
Run >NIL: RAM:rxt/PkgManager --root SYS:PkgRx --slow 500 --log RAM:rxt-pm1.log
